flowchart LR
  O[Organization desired state] --> C[Discord Desired State Compiler]
  OS[Installed OS manifests] --> C
  C --> PLAN[Plan / Diff]
  PLAN --> APPLY[Bootstrap Director]
  APPLY --> STRUCT[Roles / Categories / Channels]
  APPLY --> BIND[Dedicated OS Bot + Channel Bindings]
  BIND --> READ[Command / Routing Readback]
  READ --> DEMOTE[Remove Bootstrap Administrator]
